WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.530
Tina: Thanks for coming this far with us, Hopian.

2
00:00:05.531 --> 00:00:10.705
Hopian: The rest is up to you two. Good luck.

3
00:00:10.706 --> 00:00:12.986
Tina: Will I see you again?

4
00:00:12.987 --> 00:00:15.155
Hopian: You never know.

5
00:00:15.156 --> 00:00:22.538
The future is impossible to predict.

6
00:00:22.539 --> 00:00:25.441
Tina: I'll miss you.

7
00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:28.263
Hopian: I'll miss you too.

8
00:00:28.264 --> 00:00:31.602
Don't stay away too long, Bello.

9
00:00:31.603 --> 00:00:39.629
Remember, time will flow faster for me while you're away. Bye. Bello:

10
00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:44.563
I'll see you soon, Dad. Tina:

11
00:00:44.564 --> 00:00:48.269
The mountain looks easier to climb now. Bello:

12
00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:51.649
Yes. We visit here all the time.

13
00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:54.198
The mountain is now a park.

14
00:00:54.199 --> 00:00:57.340
Tina: It looks like a long walk.

15
00:00:57.341 --> 00:00:59.703
Bello: Well, it's still a tall mountain.

16
00:00:59.704 --> 00:01:02.084
That hasn't changed.

17
00:01:02.085 --> 00:01:04.575
Tina: I guess we should get started.

18
00:01:04.576 --> 00:01:16.008
Bello: Here, let me help.

19
00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:19.025
Tina: Look. It's the vine Danny planted.

20
00:01:19.026 --> 00:01:24.450
Bello: Wait until you see the top.

21
00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:26.507
Look over there.

22
00:01:26.508 --> 00:01:31.547
Tina: Wow. That vine has really grown in fifteen years!

23
00:01:31.548 --> 00:01:33.669
Hey, there's the rainbow. It

24
00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:36.111
looks so close. Bello:

25
00:01:36.112 --> 00:01:40.345
Yes, but it's high in the sky. Tina:

26
00:01:40.346 --> 00:01:42.663
How will we get to it? Bello:

27
00:01:42.664 --> 00:01:47.874
We'll have to figure something out. Hmm

28
00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:51.505
. . . I think it could work. Tina:

29
00:01:51.506 --> 00:01:55.272
What are you thinking? Bello:

30
00:01:55.273 --> 00:02:01.600
Tina, go stand at the other end of the park. Tina:

31
00:02:01.601 --> 00:02:03.936
Okay. Now what? Bello:

32
00:02:03.937 --> 00:02:06.629
You said you were a good runner, Tina. Tina:

33
00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:08.281
That's right. Bello:

34
00:02:08.282 --> 00:02:20.051
Good. Run as fast as you can toward me. Tina:

35
00:02:20.052 --> 00:02:23.066
It worked! It worked! Bello:

36
00:02:23.067 --> 00:02:25.586
Great job, Tina. Tina:

37
00:02:25.587 --> 00:02:38.712
But how will you get up here?

38
00:02:38.713 --> 00:02:46.456
Bello: Now, tie it tight.

39
00:02:46.457 --> 00:02:48.245
Tina: You did it!

40
00:02:48.246 --> 00:02:50.030
Bello: It wasn't that hard.

41
00:02:50.031 --> 00:02:53.351
I used to climb on those vines when I was a kid.

42
00:02:53.352 --> 00:03:04.253
Tina: It's time to slide! Let's go!

43
00:03:04.254 --> 00:03:06.105
Bello: Where are we?

44
00:03:06.106 --> 00:03:07.770
Tina: This is perfect!

45
00:03:07.771 --> 00:03:12.437
We are right beside my house!

46
00:03:12.439 --> 00:03:14.205
Bello: Who's that?

47
00:03:14.206 --> 00:03:20.036
Tina: Um, that's my neighbor, Mrs. Rice.

48
00:03:20.037 --> 00:03:22.822
Bello: She's waving at me!

49
00:03:22.823 --> 00:03:31.484
Tina: I don't think she's waving.

50
00:03:31.485 --> 00:03:34.785
Bello: I don't think she is happy to see me.

51
00:03:34.786 --> 00:03:38.429
Tina: Uh-oh.

